    "sentence_translations": [
      "Is your cat happy?",
      "",
      "How could you get to know if your cat is happy or not?",
      "Look at its tail and you will know.",
      "If the cat puts its tail up high and straight or rubs you with its body, it means the cat is happy to see you.",
      "If the tail is downwards, the cat might be sad or feel uncomfortable.",
      "If the tail is upwards while the end is curly, like a question mark, it means “come and play with me!”"
